# Search Console API — OAuth (gitignored as secrets/gsc.env)
#
# GSC "Add user" does NOT work for service accounts (email not found).
# Use OAuth with the same Google account that owns Search Console.
#
# 1. cp secrets/gsc.env.example secrets/gsc.env
# 2. Desktop OAuth client (project vlwarmte, Search Console API enabled):
#    Download JSON from GCP → secrets/gsc-oauth-desktop.json (preferred; gitignored)
#    Or set GSC_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID / GSC_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET below
#    (or reuse GOOGLE_ADS_CLIENT_ID / GOOGLE_ADS_CLIENT_SECRET in google-ads.env)
# 3. .venv/bin/python scripts/gsc_get_refresh_token.py
#    (log in as Hans / verified GSC owner)
# 4. Paste refresh token below:
#
GSC_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
GSC_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
GSC_REFRESH_TOKEN=
